examples/arm — fixture world

The .hex files under firmware/ are built from the sibling .ino sources:

  arduino-cli compile --fqbn arduino:avr:uno

Tool versions used for those images:

  arduino-cli 1.5.1
  arduino:avr core 1.8.8
  Servo library 1.3.0

The Arduino AVR core and the Servo library are LGPL-2.1, so the .hex
files are LGPL-2.1-derived object code. They are fixture data. Bench
does not link them.

The .ino sources and the $cad geometry under robot/cad are under the
repository license (MIT).
